- So we signed a two-year contract

00:38:40.260 --> 00:38:42.510
with this outside company.

00:38:42.510 --> 00:38:46.435
They offered us 3,600
bucks to split between us.

00:38:46.435 --> 00:38:48.360
- [Connor] For two years?

00:38:48.360 --> 00:38:49.193
- No, no, each month.

00:38:49.193 --> 00:38:51.090
- Oh, okay.
- Okay, okay.

00:38:51.090 --> 00:38:52.650
- I know, I know, I know.

00:38:52.650 --> 00:38:55.500
It sounded worse, it's
still not great though.

00:38:55.500 --> 00:38:58.770
So we each got 1800 bucks
and we each also invested

00:38:58.770 --> 00:39:02.610
our own money from that
into the videos themselves,

00:39:02.610 --> 00:39:04.560
and they also give us a
little bonus at the beginning.

00:39:04.560 --> 00:39:07.470
So I got to like, I had
this piece of shit car,

00:39:07.470 --> 00:39:09.930
and I couldn't do anything
'cause every time I got my car,

00:39:09.930 --> 00:39:11.100
it would not work, anyway.

00:39:11.100 --> 00:39:14.253
So I bought a new car and
I was like, you know what?

00:39:15.930 --> 00:39:18.120
We have a two-year contract
here, we're pretty safe.

00:39:18.120 --> 00:39:20.070
I could come back to do these classes

00:39:20.070 --> 00:39:21.148
if I really need to.

00:39:21.148 --> 00:39:22.080
- Okay, that makes way more sense.

00:39:22.080 --> 00:39:23.310
- Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:39:23.310 --> 00:39:24.840
- I just did six videos.

00:39:24.840 --> 00:39:28.590
- It was like one of the first deals

00:39:28.590 --> 00:39:30.690
where a company was trying
to compete with YouTube

00:39:30.690 --> 00:39:31.680
and take that audience away.

00:39:31.680 --> 00:39:35.190
And part of their contract was this video

00:39:35.190 --> 00:39:37.440
has to be exclusive to us for two weeks,

00:39:37.440 --> 00:39:39.480
and after the two-week period,

00:39:39.480 --> 00:39:40.530
you can release it to YouTube,

00:39:40.530 --> 00:39:44.100
but it has to have a
brought to you (censored)

00:39:44.100 --> 00:39:47.760
tag on the front and at the
end and a watermark on it.

00:39:47.760 --> 00:39:48.593
- Oh shit.

00:39:48.593 --> 00:39:50.220
- Still kind of generous that
they even let you do that.

00:39:50.220 --> 00:39:54.240
- It was, but their whole
strategy for marketing

00:39:54.240 --> 00:39:56.130
was that they were trying

00:39:56.130 --> 00:39:57.360
to steal the audience from YouTube.

00:39:57.360 --> 00:39:58.470
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:39:58.470 --> 00:40:00.780
- So the only way for
them to get an audience

00:40:00.780 --> 00:40:02.850
on their platform was to let people know,

00:40:02.850 --> 00:40:05.590
but unfortunately they
didn't have anything to offer

00:40:05.590 --> 00:40:09.060
that was bigger than the scope
of what YouTube had to offer.

00:40:09.060 --> 00:40:11.520
I don't need to get into
the legality behind it,

00:40:11.520 --> 00:40:13.740
but eventually we were able
to get out of that contract

00:40:13.740 --> 00:40:15.720
because they promised us a certain,

00:40:15.720 --> 00:40:18.990
wow, I don't know if I should
have said that company name.

00:40:18.990 --> 00:40:19.823
- You wanna bleep it out?

00:40:19.823 --> 00:40:20.726
- Do you wanna bleep it?

00:40:20.726 --> 00:40:21.559
- We can it out.

00:40:21.559 --> 00:40:23.820
- Mudan, bleep it out.
- Okay, thank you.

00:40:23.820 --> 00:40:26.386
Bleep out the company name. (laughing)

00:40:26.386 --> 00:40:28.017
- So now I feel more-

00:40:28.017 --> 00:40:28.990
- Now you go ham.
(all laughing)

00:40:28.990 --> 00:40:31.140
