saying everything.

00:40:32.430 --> 00:40:35.940
So they promised a certain
amount of marketing value

00:40:35.940 --> 00:40:38.220
and they translated that to
a certain amount of views.

00:40:38.220 --> 00:40:40.200
It was like some odd millions of views

00:40:40.200 --> 00:40:43.140
they were promising to bring to our videos

00:40:43.140 --> 00:40:45.120
on our channel on their platform.

00:40:45.120 --> 00:40:46.740
They did not live up to that.

00:40:46.740 --> 00:40:49.650
And when we started
getting on them about that,

00:40:49.650 --> 00:40:53.130
