how much I should say.

00:40:53.130 --> 00:40:54.330
This is how many years ago now?

00:40:54.330 --> 00:40:55.680
Jesus, it's 16 years ago.

00:40:55.680 --> 00:40:56.820
- Jesus!
- Maybe it's okay.

00:40:56.820 --> 00:41:00.090
