now getting 1,005,000 views.

00:41:26.640 --> 00:41:27.960
There's something up here.

00:41:28.921 --> 00:41:30.520
- Oh!

00:41:30.520 --> 00:41:34.893
- So I go into the comments and I get,

00:41:36.127 --> 00:41:38.730
"Fuck Smosh, what is this bullshit?

00:41:38.730 --> 00:41:40.890
I'm trying to look at my MP3s

00:41:40.890 --> 00:41:42.810
and why is this playing?"

00:41:42.810 --> 00:41:45.900
I find out that they also
own this other website

00:41:45.900 --> 00:41:48.520
and they have a little hidden iframe

00:41:49.410 --> 00:41:50.960
that's autoplaying our videos

00:41:50.960 --> 00:41:53.070
in the background of this other website.

00:41:53.070 --> 00:41:55.184
- Oh shit.
- What the fuck!

00:41:55.184 --> 00:41:56.370
- So they'd go to this website

00:41:56.370 --> 00:41:58.470
and then they'd hear
the audio of our videos

00:41:58.470 --> 00:42:01.080
while they're trying to fucking
browse this other website

00:42:01.080 --> 00:42:03.140
and it would count as a view.
(Garnt laughing)

00:42:03.140 --> 00:42:03.973
- [Joey] Oh my God!

00:42:03.973 --> 00:42:05.357
- So eventually we were able
to get out of the contract

00:42:05.357 --> 00:42:07.500
'cause were like, this is not very cool,

00:42:07.500 --> 00:42:09.300
it's actually giving us a bad reputation

00:42:09.300 --> 00:42:11.280
'cause people think
that we are doing this.

00:42:11.280 --> 00:42:13.380
And then eventually we were
able to get out of that.

00:42:13.380 --> 00:42:17.400
And it was at that time that both,

00:42:17.400 --> 00:42:22.400
oh my God, MySpace was trying
to launch a video platform.

00:42:24.052 --> 00:42:25.973
- I'm not sure if kids today
know what a MySpace is.

00:42:25.973 --> 00:42:28.233
- No, no, it's your space.

00:42:29.580 --> 00:42:31.380
So they were trying to
launch a video platform

00:42:31.380 --> 00:42:33.210
and they came to us with an offer,

00:42:33.210 --> 00:42:35.137
and then YouTube was like,

00:42:35.137 --> 00:42:37.440
"Hey, there's this program

00:42:37.440 --> 00:42:40.710
where you can make money on
your videos on our platform

00:42:40.710 --> 00:42:42.450
that never had any ads before.

00:42:42.450 --> 00:42:45.900
Would you like to be one
of the first 10 channels

00:42:45.900 --> 00:42:48.150
to ever make any money on here?

00:42:48.150 --> 00:42:49.590
We'll give you a guarantee."

00:42:49.590 --> 00:42:52.080
And even though they're
guarantee was lower than MySpace,

00:42:52.080 --> 00:42:53.580
thank everything in the world,

00:42:53.580 --> 00:42:56.700
we said, "Yeah, we'll stick with YouTube."

00:42:56.700 --> 00:42:58.620
And that's kind of where
everything started,

00:42:58.620 --> 00:42:59.850
that was early 2007.

00:42:59.850 --> 00:43:00.870
That's when we-

00:43:00.870 --> 00:43:02.640
- Was that just like, were
you guys just guessing

00:43:02.640 --> 00:43:04.050
