00:44:31.266 --> 00:44:32.347
(all laughing)

00:44:32.347 --> 00:44:33.448
- My top eight business friends.

00:44:33.448 --> 00:44:35.434
- I'm like, shit, if he goes
on my page he's gonna know!

00:44:35.434 --> 00:44:36.783
(all laughing)
Oh shit!

00:44:38.190 --> 00:44:39.474
I think he does photography now,

00:44:39.474 --> 00:44:40.307
