we might get for that.

00:45:09.767 --> 00:45:11.253
- That's so funny.

00:45:13.440 --> 00:45:15.360
- We enabled it on our older videos

00:45:15.360 --> 00:45:16.740
and then the newest video we waited

00:45:16.740 --> 00:45:19.980
