audience came in and left

00:45:19.980 --> 00:45:21.750
so that we wouldn't get flak for it.

00:45:21.750 --> 00:45:23.467
And even on our older
videos, people were like,

00:45:23.467 --> 00:45:25.194
"Whoa, you fucking sellouts!"

00:45:25.194 --> 00:45:26.490
(all laughing)

00:45:26.490 --> 00:45:28.620
It's an ad where you go your mouse,

00:45:28.620 --> 00:45:30.780
no one's one's on mobile,
you're on your computer,

00:45:30.780 --> 00:45:32.280
and all you have to do is move
your mouse and click the X.

00:45:32.280 --> 00:45:34.667
And people are like, "ugh, fuck this!"

00:45:34.667 --> 00:45:36.450
