01:02:07.015 --> 01:02:07.953
- And then they were like,
nah, we'll get rid of it.

01:02:07.953 --> 01:02:09.630
- I get it though, YouTube
has been constantly,

01:02:09.630 --> 01:02:10.560
especially into earlier days,

