it did seem like it was like,

01:02:11.640 --> 01:02:12.480
what the fuck is-

01:02:12.480 --> 01:02:15.510
- It felt very fragile for a while.

01:02:15.510 --> 01:02:18.693
Yeah, so they presented it to us as,

01:02:19.620 --> 01:02:21.210
we're gonna take all the website,

01:02:21.210 --> 01:02:22.620
Smosh.com stuff off your plate,

01:02:22.620 --> 01:02:25.544
because I was doing all of that myself,

01:02:25.544 --> 01:02:27.870
because I actually made money

01:02:27.870 --> 01:02:30.150
