01:02:30.150 --> 01:02:31.863
by designing websites for people.

01:02:33.090 --> 01:02:35.910
And that's how I was able
to fund a lot of things

01:02:35.910 --> 01:02:37.953
and, you know, side tangent,

01:02:38.847 --> 01:02:40.740
our videos actually started getting,

01:02:40.740 --> 01:02:43.873
we made like two lip sync
videos before the Pokemon theme.

