Keep it coming!

01:02:47.250 --> 01:02:48.550
- Doing a little test run!

01:02:50.777 --> 01:02:52.650
- Before we found out about YouTube

01:02:52.650 --> 01:02:56.823
and I hosted it on my own website.

01:02:58.770 --> 01:03:00.990
Because there was no website
like YouTube to host it on.

01:03:00.990 --> 01:03:02.194
- Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

01:03:02.194 --> 01:03:05.490
