02:02:45.330 --> 02:02:47.130
- Yeah, I guess like, sorry.

02:02:47.130 --> 02:02:47.963
- No, I was just saying,

02:02:47.963 --> 02:02:50.640
I feel like in a weird way,

02:02:50.640 --> 02:02:52.650
we are still trying to figure out

02:02:52.650 --> 02:02:55.140
that formula for Trash Taste in a sense.

02:02:55.140 --> 02:02:56.539
It's like, we've kind of figured it out.

02:02:56.539 --> 02:02:57.762
It's obviously a lot-

02:02:57.762 --> 02:02:59.226
- 100 episodes deep, don't
know what the fuck's going on.

02:02:59.226 --> 02:03:00.122
