off the the bat you know,

02:05:26.220 --> 02:05:27.810
there was this effort that went into this,

02:05:27.810 --> 02:05:29.430
this is a good setup for this video.

02:05:29.430 --> 02:05:30.870
'Cause I know that if
the rest of this video

02:05:30.870 --> 02:05:32.430
is anything like these first 30 seconds,

02:05:32.430 --> 02:05:33.840
it's gonna be so much fun.

02:05:33.840 --> 02:05:36.150
So I was like, how could I
apply some of these things

02:05:36.150 --> 02:05:39.447
