02:06:30.210 --> 02:06:32.880
- No, I'm just having fun, man.

02:06:32.880 --> 02:06:34.980
If I enjoy what I'm doing,

02:06:34.980 --> 02:06:38.370
I feel like that is the best
career that you could have,

02:06:38.370 --> 02:06:39.897
is where you enjoy it.
- Yeah, definitely.

02:06:39.897 --> 02:06:43.110
